# VLOnto core subset 0.1.0 (2026-11-11): ontology + documents of legal-force rank <= 2 (Constitution, codes, laws, National Assembly resolutions, ordinances and Standing Committee resolutions) with their change events, legal-basis links and citations among themselves (article-level citations projected to document level), issuers, legal areas, precedents, source datasets, edge sets and the build activity. Full graph: vlonto-kg.nt.gz.
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix eli: <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#> .
@prefix org: <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix vann: <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/> .
@prefix vlarea: <https://tmquan.github.io/VLOnto/id/area/> .
@prefix vlbuild: <https://tmquan.github.io/VLOnto/id/build/> .
@prefix vlchange: <https://tmquan.github.io/VLOnto/id/change/> .
@prefix vldocume: <https://tmquan.github.io/VLOnto/id/document/> .
